Package: curatedMetagenomicData
Title: Curated Metagenomic Data of the Human Microbiome
Version: 4.0.0
Date: 2026-04-08
Description:
    The curatedMetagenomicData package provides standardized, curated human
    microbiome data for novel analyses. Starting with version 4 ("cMD4"),
    sample-level profiling data is served from a published DuckDB catalog of
    hive-partitioned parquet files produced by the curatedMetagenomicDataETL
    pipeline. Sample metadata is shipped directly with the package as the
    harmonized_meta (schema-only) and all_meta (schema plus under-harmonization
    columns) data.frame objects, derived from
    curatedMetagenomicDataCuration::makeCombinedMetadata(); the runtime
    package itself does not depend on curatedMetagenomicDataCuration. Users
    filter harmonized_meta or all_meta to the samples of interest and call
    returnSamples() to obtain a SummarizedExperiment assembled across studies
    on demand.
